{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/howtopreviewandtest"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drive "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsService"},{"type":"text","text":" from SwiftUI previews and Swift Testing suites without touching Mixpanel’s network."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToPreviewAndTest"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Related Documentation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockServiceReference"],"anchor":"Related-Documentation"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToImplementService"],"anchor":"How-to-Guides","title":"How-to Guides","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"text":" calls into a real ","type":"text"},{"code":"MixpanelInstance","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". For previews and tests, swap it for ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"text":" — an actor that records every call and exposes its history for assertions. The mock has no Mixpanel dependency and runs offline.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"In a SwiftUI preview","anchor":"In-a-SwiftUI-preview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Inject a mock-backed store and the analytics work flows without spinning up the SDK:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["#Preview {","    let store = AppStore.configured(analyticsService: MockMixpanelAnalyticsService())","    return ContentView().environment(store)","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This requires that "},{"code":"AppStore.configured","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" accepts an injected "},{"code":"AnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". See Swidux’s "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/Swidux\/documentation\/swidux\/howtoaddanalytics"},{"type":"text","text":" guide for the factory pattern."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"In a Swift Testing suite","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"In-a-Swift-Testing-suite"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the mock to verify mapper behavior. Await the plugin’s "},{"code":"flush()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to make assertions deterministic:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","import Testing","","@Test","func incrementMapsToCounterAdded() async {","    let mock = MockMixpanelAnalyticsService()","    let store = AppStore.configured(analyticsService: mock)","","    store.send(.counter(.increment(5)))","    await store.analyticsPlugin.flush()","","    let events = await mock.trackedEvents","    #expect(events.first?.name == \"counter_added\")","    #expect(events.first?.properties[\"amount\"] == .int(5))","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Asserting on identify and alias","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Asserting-on-identify-and-alias"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The mock records identify and alias calls in order:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["@Test","func userSignInIdentifies() async {","    let mock = MockMixpanelAnalyticsService()","    let store = AppStore.configured(analyticsService: mock)","","    store.send(.auth(.signIn(userID: \"user-1\")))","    await store.analyticsPlugin.flush()","","    let calls = await mock.identifyCalls","    #expect(calls == [.init(userID: \"user-1\", properties: [\"tier\": .string(\"free\")])])","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"type":"text","text":" is an actor, so its accessors are async — wrap them in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"await"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"article","sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"How to Preview and Test","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"}]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"references":{"https://heirloomlogic.github.io/Swidux/documentation/swidux/howtoaddanalytics":{"titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Add Analytics","type":"text"}],"url":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/Swidux\/documentation\/swidux\/howtoaddanalytics","title":"Add Analytics","type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/Swidux\/documentation\/swidux\/howtoaddanalytics"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/GettingStarted":{"role":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the package, build "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"type":"text","text":" with your token, register the analytics plugin, and start dispatching events."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/gettingstarted","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/GettingStarted","type":"topic","kind":"article","title":"Getting Started with SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Recording "},{"code":"AnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for previews and Swift Testing suites."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","title":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","fragments":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/mockmixpanelanalyticsservice","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService"}]},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/MockServiceReference":{"role":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"API reference for "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"type":"text","text":" — a recording "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsService"},{"type":"text","text":" for SwiftUI previews and Swift Testing suites."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/mockservicereference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockServiceReference","type":"topic","kind":"article","title":"Mock Service Reference"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/HowToImplementService":{"role":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Configure "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"type":"text","text":" to match your privacy, residency, and batching needs — without "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import Mixpanel"},{"type":"text","text":" in your app."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/howtoimplementservice","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToImplementService","type":"topic","kind":"article","title":"How to Implement the Service"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics":{"role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Mixpanel adapter for Swidux’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsPlugin"},{"type":"text","text":". Owns the Mixpanel SDK on the app’s behalf — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService(token:)"},{"type":"text","text":" calls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mixpanel.initialize"},{"type":"text","text":" internally so apps never need to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import Mixpanel"},{"type":"text","text":". Ships a recording mock for previews and tests."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","type":"topic","title":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","kind":"symbol"}}}